# Used by the HermiT check, not by the shapes: one test result typed as both passing and failing, two test statuses that the T-Box declares disjoint.
@prefix o4de: <http://www.zt4swe.io/o4de#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
o4de:BothResult a owl:NamedIndividual, o4de:Passing, o4de:Failing ; rdfs:label "Both passing and failing" .
